1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:05,889
In space, a changing signal can tell more than one story.

2
00:00:06,139 --> 00:00:10,583
The environment may have changed. The body may be responding.

3
00:00:10,833 --> 00:00:14,389
Or the sensor may have lost reliable contact.

4
00:00:15,239 --> 00:00:17,906
Meet ASTER: an offline-capable research console

5
00:00:18,156 --> 00:00:20,822
that brings those possibilities into view.

6
00:00:21,672 --> 00:00:25,228
Breathing and Exposure aligns local carbon dioxide measurements

7
00:00:25,478 --> 00:00:27,256
with the respiratory cycle.

8
00:00:27,506 --> 00:00:31,506
It explores what the crew member may be inhaling,

9
00:00:31,756 --> 00:00:34,867
while showing the limits of the estimate.

10
00:00:35,717 --> 00:00:39,717
Sensor Integrity checks the quality of the measurement connection.

11
00:00:39,967 --> 00:00:43,967
When contact becomes unreliable, ASTER marks the affected interpretation

12
00:00:44,217 --> 00:00:48,217
instead of presenting uncertain data as a confident conclusion.

13
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:53,511
Exercise and Muscle Response compares similar activity under similar loads,

14
00:00:53,761 --> 00:00:57,761
with mechanical signals and fluid-sensitive measurements kept in context.

15
00:00:58,611 --> 00:01:02,611
Each event connects observations, quality checks, and versioned rules

16
00:01:02,861 --> 00:01:04,639
to an inspectable explanation.

17
00:01:05,489 --> 00:01:10,378
When the ground link is unavailable, the case remains accessible locally.

18
00:01:10,628 --> 00:01:15,072
When communication resumes, its evidence can be delivered and reviewed,

19
00:01:15,322 --> 00:01:18,433
with replies linked to the correct revision.

20
00:01:19,283 --> 00:01:23,283
A reproducible simulation lab lets researchers challenge these methods

21
00:01:23,533 --> 00:01:26,644
with noise, missing data, and conflicting signals.

22
00:01:27,494 --> 00:01:31,494
ASTER is a research prototype, demonstrated with simulated data.

23
00:01:31,744 --> 00:01:35,744
Its purpose is to make the evidence, the uncertainty,

24
00:01:35,994 --> 00:01:38,661
and the next research step visible.

